# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows writes CRLF, and the repo then fails its own
# `npm run lint`: prettier is configured for LF, so it reports every line of
# every file as an error — six thousand of them, none of them real. Pinning the
# line ending here fixes it for everyone rather than in each person's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, and large. Keep it out of diffs.
bun.lock linguist-generated=true -diff

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
